{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Gerson Boom\n🔨 Blacksmith, historian, and best-selling writer, author of the *Lord of the Hammer* saga (inspired by the Prophecy).","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nHis main student — he mentors her throughout Ch.4, and her fight as Hammer of Justice works almost like a rite of passage for her, in a direct parallel to his role as…","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Alvin**\nHis son, caretaker of his grave and his old historian's office.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nHis revival as a Darkner depends directly on the Dark Sanctuaries the Knight himself creates upon arriving in Ch.4 — without him, Gerson would still be just dust on a hammer.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nAlthough they never actually meet in person, she is the most devoted fan of Dragon Blazers, the video game saga based on Gerson's book — she plays it with her father Rudy, secretly shares it with…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Why \"Ms. Boom\"?**\nA relative named \"Ms. is mentioned.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/old-man-gerson.png","x":-67,"y":-295,"width":175,"height":190},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Another echo of Gaster?**\nThe pattern of \"a vanished genius whose legacy weighs on the next one\" recalls Gaster and his Followers — with the difference that Gerson actively encourages Alvin to move past it. A thematic parallel noted by the official wiki.","x":-680,"y":770,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Parallel with J. R. R. Tolkien**\nBoth historians/professors turned fantasy authors who left their work unfinished when they died — the difference lies in the son who does(n't) continue the work, until Alvin finally writes his own sermon in Ch.5.","x":-340,"y":770,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**The real origin of the name**\nConfirmed by Toby Fox in 2018: it comes from a Smash Bros. 64 match at a Peruvian tournament (2014) between players Gerson and SuPeRbOoMfAn (\"Boom\"). Alvin, the winner of that round, gives the son his name.","x":0,"y":770,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Alvin_overwolrd.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gerson_ms.boom.webp","x":-935,"y":435,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_knight_gaster","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_susie_alvin","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_noelle_susie","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_tolkien_gaster","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_msboom_alvin","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}